WEBVTT

00:14:59.148 --> 00:15:03.678
I will be tweeting out the answer later on today. (Laughter)

00:15:03.678 --> 00:15:06.313
Actually, it's a bit more complex than that,

00:15:06.313 --> 00:15:08.392
and there are no magic bullets.

00:15:08.392 --> 00:15:10.104
I don't have all the answers,

00:15:10.104 --> 00:15:11.768
but I know a few things.

00:15:11.768 --> 00:15:14.465
In the wake of 9/11,

00:15:14.465 --> 00:15:17.255
the best security minds

00:15:17.255 --> 00:15:19.239
put together all their innovation

00:15:19.239 --> 00:15:23.378
and this is what they created for security.

00:15:23.378 --> 00:15:27.399
If you're expecting the people who built this to protect you

00:15:27.399 --> 00:15:31.115
from the coming robopocalypse — (Laughter)